Assertions:
[EVIDENCE] touch may itself be refused (400) if the return is already decided and updateReturn only allows Draft edits, and errors[] on it is recorded here as evidence only — this case's verdict is the notification counts, not the touch's own status (an errors[] empty assertion here would contradict that stated tolerance)
[DATA label=after_push] data.pushMessages.totalCount = {{PUSH_BEFORE}}
[VAR] {{JOURNAL_AFTER_COUNT}} = {{JOURNAL_BEFORE_COUNT}}

[EVIDENCE] ensure_decided is either 200 or 400 WRONG_STATUS - both fine
[ERRORS label=put_decision_change] HTTP 200
[DATA label=read_after_decision_change] body.lineItems[?id={{lineA}}].approvedQuantity = {{LA_APPROVED}}
[DATA label=read_after_decision_change] body.lineItems[?id={{lineA}}].itemState = {{LA_STATE}}
[DATA label=read_after_decision_change] body.lineItems[?id={{lineA}}].rejectReason is null
[ERRORS label=put_qty_change] HTTP 400
[DATA label=put_qty_change] body.[0] matches /has been approved or declined, so its quantity cannot be changed/i
[DATA label=read_back] body.lineItems[?id={{lineA}}].quantity = {{LA_QTY}}
[DATA label=read_back] body.lineItems[?id={{lineA}}].approvedQuantity = {{LA_APPROVED}}

[EVIDENCE] ensure_decided is either 200 or 400 WRONG_STATUS - both fine
[ERRORS label=put_price] HTTP 200
[DATA label=read_priced] body.lineItems[?id={{lineA}}].price = 1.23
[DATA label=read_priced] body.lineItems[?id={{lineA}}].approvedQuantity = {{LA_APPROVED}}
[DATA label=read_priced] body.lineItems[?id={{lineA}}].itemState = {{LA_STATE}}
[DATA label=read_priced] body.lineItems[?id={{lineA}}].reasonCode is null
[DATA label=read_priced] body.lineItems[?id={{lineA}}].attachments.0.url is non-null
[COUNT label=read_priced] body.lineItems.length = 2
[ERRORS label=restore_price] HTTP 200
[DATA label=read_restored] body.lineItems[?id={{lineA}}].price = {{LA_PRICE}}
